results.description:
We’re looking for an AI Automation Engineer to build and launch an automated video production pipeline for Counter-Strike 2 content.  
The goal is to automate the full workflow for YouTube Shorts, Instagram Reels, and TikTok — from content sourcing and AI processing to editing, voice-over, subtitles, publishing, and performance tracking.

Responsibilities  
Design and build an end-to-end video automation pipeline from scratch;  
Build complex n8n workflows with schedules, queues, conditions, parallel branches, retries, and error handling;  
Integrate LLMs and AI APIs such as OpenAI, Anthropic, and others;  
Integrate video generation, processing, and editing services via API;  
Automate AI avatars, lipsync, voice-over, dubbing, and character modifications;  
Automate video editing: different sources, scenes, hooks, subtitles, and voice-over;  
Set up scheduled publishing via YouTube Data API, Instagram Graph API, and other platform APIs;  
Work with OAuth, multiple accounts, API limits, and logging;  
Implement automated pre-publish checks: descriptions, hashtags, stop-lists, and AI-content labels;  
Build an operator dashboard for content calendar, queues, errors, providers, and content types;  
Collect performance metrics and optimize content distribution based on results;  
Monitor, troubleshoot, and scale the pipeline to new platforms and channels;  
Maintain technical documentation: README, ARCHITECTURE, RUNBOOK.

Requirements  
Hands-on experience building automation workflows / pipelines from scratch;  
Strong n8n experience with complex production workflows;  
Knowledge of Python or JavaScript for custom scripts;  
Experience with REST APIs, Webhooks, and OAuth;  
Experience integrating LLMs / AI APIs such as OpenAI or Anthropic;  
Experience with video generation, processing, or editing APIs;  
Experience with social media publishing APIs such as YouTube API / Instagram Graph API;  
Ability to independently break down a task, choose the right tools, build the solution, and bring it to stable production;  
English sufficient for reading technical documentation.

Nice to have  
Experience with AI content generation pipelines;  
Experience with FFmpeg or similar video-processing tools;  
Experience with AI avatars, lipsync, TTS/STT, voice cloning, or dubbing;  
Experience automating TikTok, Reels, or YouTube Shorts;  
Experience with Zapier, Make (Integromat), or similar automation tools;  
Understanding of monitoring, logging, queues, and fault-tolerant workflows.

What We Value  
We’re looking for someone who can own the entire automation flow — from architecture and tool selection to MVP, production launch, optimization, and scaling.  
We value autonomy, ownership, and a result-oriented mindset.  
And if you play CS2 / CS, that’s an extra bonus — we also run internal CS2 tournaments 🎮

Основные задачи:

- Доработка БД: создание и модификация таблиц PostgreSQL под новые функциональные блоки программы;
- Администрирование Directus: настройка и расширение админ-панели для управления контентом и пользовательскими данными;
- Интеграция систем: настройка взаимодействия между Directus, n8n и другими компонентами инфраструктуры;
- Разработка механик: внедрение новых функциональных блоков (треки, обучение, уведомления, рассылки);
- Миграция данных: перенос существующих данных при расширении функционала;
- Коммуникация с клиентом: 1 раз в неделю регулярный статус; коммуникация в чате с командой разработки.

Требования:

- Работа с Directus CMS: опыт настройки и администрирования;
- PostgreSQL: уверенное владение, проектирование БД;
- n8n: опыт работы с low-code оркестратором;
- API-интеграции: опыт работы с OAuth2/OIDC (Keycloak);
- Веб-технологии: понимание принципов работы веб-приложений.

🌱 Дополнительные требования: локация РФ или возможность работы через РФ компьютер через корп. VPN клиента.

А что взамен? 🩷 Работа на удалёнке, оплата на уровне рынка.

Скорее отправляйте отклики сами и делитесь вакансией с друзьями!
